rg, arginine; Gln, glutamine; Glu, glutamate; Gly, glycine; Ileu, isoleucine; Leu, leucine; Lys, lysine; PUFAs, polyunsaturated fatty acids; PC, phosphocholine; TGL, triglycerides; TMA, trimethylamine; TMAO, trimethylamine-<italic>N</italic>-oxide. For abbreviations of other metabolites, refer to keys in <xref ref-type="fig" rid="f3">Figures 3</xref> and <xref ref-type="fig" rid="f4">4</xref>.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>